    "updated_at": "2018-12-14T07:03:59Z",
    "body": "@annevk If you replace the global static list of MOs by the dynamic list of active MOs, the test issue mentioned above disappeared because you will be iterating over active MOs that have a pending notification which is strictly equivalent to looping through all MOs (current spec) but filter out those who had no pending notification at the start of the loop (currently proposed edit).\r\n\r\nBasically those two issues are one and the same according to my understanding, which is why I commented here.",
